  "tnoc": "Not applicable: 6.18 has no itnoc_remove/platform driver; AMBA TNOC is unchanged",
  "replay_patch": "required-common-fixes.patch",
  "local_changes": [
    "Typed thermal device registration for Xiaomi thermal policy ABI",
    "Qualcomm CSR helper subtype for native ETR ATID routing",
    "SRCU lifetime for unloadable native CTI association callbacks",
    "Distinct Qualcomm QMI/TGU helper subtypes avoid CATU helper misidentification",
    "Owned native HVC backend publication, callback SRCU lifetime, retained TTY indices and generation keys",
    "Validate Gunyah console notification header/tail against real received size before unsized notifier dispatch",
    "Trust the pinned accepted GKI public certificate so preserved modules retain protected-export authorization after kernel rebuild",
    "Remove interior certificate-list alignment so the native X.509 loader reaches the added public certificate",
    "Native CAN USB/virtual/ISO-TP/J1939, USB serial generic/adapters, Bluetooth USB, network filesystems and host-network diagnostics with exact ARM64 module outputs",
    "Defer timerfd resume cancellation notifications on the freezable workqueue until actual system resume, preserving timer expiry and explicit clock changes",
    "Order PF_BLOCK_TS clearing before plug detachment with a compiler barrier while retaining AutoFDO"
  ],
